      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "To add: I think it would be useful to have another feature to *inherit* the current instance type. So if you're currently in an Invite+, it will make the portal Invite+. Or if you're in a Group+, it can make Group+ instance in that group if anyone goes through the portal.\n\nI made a separate feature request, since I think that functionality is different enough from this.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/options-for-vrc-world-portals-to-inherit-current-instance-type",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
